B.PH=new A.bd("Render Tree Hierarchy Flow","FLUTTER CORE","CORE PIPELINE","The Flutter Rendering Pipeline flows linearly in 4 dedicated phases under 60Hz/120Hz VSync boundaries:\n\n1. LAYOUT: Parent defines constraints down, Child defines geometry size up. RenderObjects compute dimensions.\n2. PAINT: RenderObjects record draw directives onto a Canvas layer.\n3. COMPOSITE: Multiple canvases are composited inside layered scene nodes to avoid complete screen redraws.\n4. RASTERIZE: Skia / Impeller converts the composited scene description into raw GPU pixels.","class CustomRenderWidget extends LeafRenderObjectWidget {\n  @override\n  RenderObject createRenderObject(BuildContext context) => RenderParagraphBox();\n}",B.L8)
