B.PE=new A.bd("InheritedModel Aspect Rebuilds","STATE PROPAGATION","PARTIAL REBUILDS","While standard InheritedWidget triggers element rebuilds whenever any state mutations occur, `InheritedModel` allows binding rebuild constraints to specific aspects of the data model. Child widgets will only repaint if their observed aspect changes.",'class UserStore extends InheritedModel<String> {\n  const UserStore({required this.user, required super.child});\n  final UserProfile user;\n  @override\n  bool updateShouldNotifyDependent(UserStore old, Set<String> deps) {\n    return deps.contains("name") && user.name != old.user.name;\n  }\n  @override\n  bool updateShouldNotify(UserStore old) => user != old.user;\n}',B.Lr)
